    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a frozen zombie apocalypse, a father turning into a vampire must use supernatural powers to protect his daughter - but each hunt erodes his remaining humanity. When human blood becomes essential for survival, how can this vampire father keep his vow to 'never harm humans'? The zombies might ironically become his most honest allies...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Introductions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/26085b550160b9686d3b5e459b176dea.avif?t=1755479448\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/b98a49b83546edde1b867cfb0855d35a.avif?t=1755479448\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Henry Tarnaki: A European man in his mid-40s. Before the zombie outbreak, he was a painter who loved skiing\u2014introverted and gentle, often taking his daughter on ski trips. After the apocalypse, he fled with his daughter to the mountains, occasionally venturing into the city for supplies. Later, he was bitten by a mutated bat in the snowy wilderness, transforming into a vampire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/3ab082fdba31d10fe0db6de984617d9f.avif?t=1755479448\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rose Tarnaki: An 8-year-old girl, Henry\u2019s daughter and a skilled skier. Cheerful, mischievous, and optimistic, she survives alongside her father in the mountains after the outbreak, relying on each other in this harsh world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/c8650e253e901f9077221c4ccc938cca.avif?t=1755479448\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luca Newman: A 30-year-old Asian survivor, slightly overweight. Near death, he was rescued by Rose but later betrayed her after discovering their well-stocked shelter. He informed Anderson Hill, the ruthless leader of a scavenger group, leading to a confrontation. Eventually, Luca mutated into the Zombie King and challenged Henry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/f75e5ae30797ddc1054f77b50854d0f1.avif?t=1755479448\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anderson Hill: A European man in his mid-40s, formerly a soldier. After the outbreak, he formed an armed group to plunder supplies, known for his brutality and merciless tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/befcc1b2d299002c7f588efab1483e3c.poster.avif?t=1755479448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/befcc1b2d299002c7f588efab1483e3c.webm?t=1755479448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/befcc1b2d299002c7f588efab1483e3c.mp4?t=1755479448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person narrative for immersive experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/1bca11859a2830f1cb28865bd16ffca7.poster.avif?t=1755479448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/1bca11859a2830f1cb28865bd16ffca7.webm?t=1755479448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/1bca11859a2830f1cb28865bd16ffca7.mp4?t=1755479448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-apocalyptic story exploring humanity and family bonds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/054df393e8abbf5fe01bbef41bcda1a2.poster.avif?t=1755479448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/054df393e8abbf5fe01bbef41bcda1a2.webm?t=1755479448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/054df393e8abbf5fe01bbef41bcda1a2.mp4?t=1755479448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich characters with diverse personalities</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a frozen zombie apocalypse, a father turning into a vampire must use supernatural powers to protect his daughter - but each hunt erodes his remaining humanity. When human blood becomes essential for survival, how can this vampire father keep his vow to 'never harm humans'? The zombies might ironically become his most honest allies...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Introductions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/26085b550160b9686d3b5e459b176dea.avif?t=1755479448\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/b98a49b83546edde1b867cfb0855d35a.avif?t=1755479448\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Henry Tarnaki: A European man in his mid-40s. Before the zombie outbreak, he was a painter who loved skiing\u2014introverted and gentle, often taking his daughter on ski trips. After the apocalypse, he fled with his daughter to the mountains, occasionally venturing into the city for supplies. Later, he was bitten by a mutated bat in the snowy wilderness, transforming into a vampire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/3ab082fdba31d10fe0db6de984617d9f.avif?t=1755479448\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rose Tarnaki: An 8-year-old girl, Henry\u2019s daughter and a skilled skier. Cheerful, mischievous, and optimistic, she survives alongside her father in the mountains after the outbreak, relying on each other in this harsh world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/c8650e253e901f9077221c4ccc938cca.avif?t=1755479448\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luca Newman: A 30-year-old Asian survivor, slightly overweight. Near death, he was rescued by Rose but later betrayed her after discovering their well-stocked shelter. He informed Anderson Hill, the ruthless leader of a scavenger group, leading to a confrontation. Eventually, Luca mutated into the Zombie King and challenged Henry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/f75e5ae30797ddc1054f77b50854d0f1.avif?t=1755479448\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anderson Hill: A European man in his mid-40s, formerly a soldier. After the outbreak, he formed an armed group to plunder supplies, known for his brutality and merciless tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/befcc1b2d299002c7f588efab1483e3c.poster.avif?t=1755479448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/befcc1b2d299002c7f588efab1483e3c.webm?t=1755479448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/befcc1b2d299002c7f588efab1483e3c.mp4?t=1755479448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person narrative for immersive experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/1bca11859a2830f1cb28865bd16ffca7.poster.avif?t=1755479448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/1bca11859a2830f1cb28865bd16ffca7.webm?t=1755479448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/1bca11859a2830f1cb28865bd16ffca7.mp4?t=1755479448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-apocalyptic story exploring humanity and family bonds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/054df393e8abbf5fe01bbef41bcda1a2.poster.avif?t=1755479448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/054df393e8abbf5fe01bbef41bcda1a2.webm?t=1755479448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568160/extras/054df393e8abbf5fe01bbef41bcda1a2.mp4?t=1755479448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich characters with diverse personalities</p>",
